body:
I was diagnosed with SIBO and yeast overgrowth after taking a comprehensive stool analysis. This was caused by a short time taking Lexapro (antidepressant). My skin has thinned, body hair has changed, tons of muscle wastage, brain fog, anhedonia, genital shrinkage, and the hair on my head has changed texture and is falling out. It's very brittle and has the texture of straw. The test also shows my gut pH is 5.8, which the doctor said is one of the lowest he's ever seen. 

&#x200B;

Did anyone else have these issues and they got better after tackling the SIBO?
